    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "📧 EMAIL VERIFICATION AUTOMATION\n================================\n\nThis workflow automatically verifies email addresses using MailTester.Ninja API to eliminate fake emails and improve deliverability.\n\nSETUP STEPS:\n1. Get your API key from MailTester.Ninja \n2. Activate your token at: https://happy.mailtester.ninja/ninja\n3. Replace the token in Edit Fields node with your activated token\n4. Add email addresses to verify in the Edit Fields node\n\nHOW IT WORKS:\n- Edit Fields → Sets email & token\n- HTTP Request → Calls MailTester.ninja API\n- Code Node → Parses verification response\n- Filter → Routes valid/invalid emails\n\nRESPONSE CODES:\n✅ \"accepted\" = Valid email\n❌ \"invalid\" = Fake/dead email  \n⚠️ \"unverifiable\" = Catch-all (use with caution)\n\nRESULTS: 0.3% bounce rate | 47% open rate | 100k emails/day\n\nCreated by LeadGenMan × MailTester.Ninja\nFull guide: https://resources.leadgenman.com/mailtesterninja",
